cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Narwhal Delta in research, cite the software version and archive the exact source commit and analysis bundle."
title: "Narwhal Delta: Traceable Underwater Survey Differencing"
authors:
  - family-names: Abernathy
    given-names: Jereme
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-25
url: "https://github.com/jeremedotxyz/narwhal-delta"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jeremedotxyz/narwhal-delta"
abstract: "A local engineering reference for repeat-survey elevation differencing, conditional uncertainty thresholds, connected change regions, and reproducible evidence bundles. Validation uses synthetic survey pairs; physical hydrographic accuracy is not established."
keywords:
  - underwater lidar
  - bathymetry
  - survey differencing
  - uncertainty
  - reproducibility
